  {
   "rating": 24,
   "date": "2006-01-29T18:43:28-06:00",
   "body": "- as it's unique, you can only have one in the bank at a time\n\n- none of the blasted lands buffs stack with each other\n\n- this is also needed for the lesser arcanum of rumination, which is an enchant for heads or legs for +150 mana, useable by anybody",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 8,
   "date": "2005-10-12T06:43:28-05:00",
   "body": "For the long boss fights, i.e. Mag, Golemagg, etc. when you are in rotation and need to be sitting regenning mana, this makes a big difference. Definitely worth farming.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 1,
   "date": "2020-03-13T08:18:34-05:00",
   "body": "If you don't see any kill of the critters you need start killing ALL the felbeasts in the area. Then Helboar, buzzards, scorpids and basilisks etc will take the opened spawn locations. If you ignore the Felbeasts they will take over all the spawn locations and make the spawns you need more rare.\r\n\r\nDon't understand why more people don't understand this!",
   "replies": []
  },
